cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Real-Time Object Detection in the Browser (YOLO26 + WebGPU)"
abstract: >-
  Free, open-source web app that detects and tracks objects in a webcam feed or
  video file in real time, entirely inside the browser, using YOLO26 and YOLOE
  models on WebGPU via ONNX Runtime Web. Nothing is uploaded.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Adeel
    given-names: Rafay
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-09
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/CodeRafay/realtime-object-detection"
url: "https://webgpu-object-detection.vercel.app/"
keywords:
  - object detection
  - object tracking
  - YOLO26
  - YOLOE
  - WebGPU
  - ONNX Runtime Web
  - computer vision
  - in-browser machine learning
